  ST018 ARM) are compiled from ares (https://github.com/ares-emulator/ares, at
  the commit pinned in versions.json, cores.ares): its processor cores
  ares/component/processor/upd96050 and arm7tdmi, the Super Famicom driver
  files ares/sfc/coprocessor/necdsp/memory.cpp and armdsp/memory.cpp and
  io.cpp, and the nall headers they use, with romdev's glue (MIT) restating
